# This file is generated by dune, edit dune-project instead
opam-version: "2.0"
version: "1.0.2"
synopsis: "Typed OCaml toolkit for the AT Protocol"
description: """
Typed OCaml toolkit for the AT Protocol. Resolve identities, read and write repositories, follow the firehose, and call AppView, Ozone, and hosted Bluesky products (chat, video, Jetstream) from one library. Protocol pieces (XRPC, CID/CAR/MST, lexicons, OAuth/DPoP) are implemented here, not left as raw HTTP.

This package is a client. It does not host a PDS, chat service, video transcoder, Tap, SMS gateway, or push backend.

Key modules: Auth, Session, Identity, Actor, Feed, Graph, Repo, Records, Sync, Repo_sync, Firehose, Jetstream, Oauth, Chat, Video, Ozone, Notification, Contact, Lexicon, and experimental Lt_hash / At_uri.Space / Space_* (proposal 0016; not a spaces product API).

Until atproto.1.0.2 is published, pin the GitHub repository (see the README); then `opam install atproto`. Requires OCaml >= 4.14.1 and < 5.4 (CI: 4.14.1 and 5.3.0). Jane Street core / async / ppx_jane / zstandard are >= v0.16.0 and < v0.18~ (v0.16 on OCaml 4.14, v0.17 on OCaml 5.1-5.3). System libzstd is required."""
maintainer: ["david-engelmann <david.engelmann44@gmail.com>"]
authors: ["david-engelmann <david.engelmann44@gmail.com>"]
license: "MIT"
tags: ["atproto" "bluesky" "xrpc" "lexicon"]
homepage: "https://github.com/david-engelmann/atproto"
doc: "https://david-engelmann.github.io/atproto/"
bug-reports: "https://github.com/david-engelmann/atproto/issues"
depends: [
  "dune" {>= "3.11"}
  "ocaml" {>= "4.14.1" & < "5.4"}
  "core" {>= "v0.16.0" & < "v0.18~"}
  "async" {>= "v0.16.0" & < "v0.18~"}
  "uri" {>= "4.2.0"}
  "yojson"
  "ptime"
  "lwt" {>= "5.6.1"}
  "h2" {>= "0.10.0"}
  "h2-lwt-unix" {>= "0.10.0"}
  "httpaf" {>= "0.7.1"}
  "httpaf-lwt-unix"
  "cohttp" {>= "5.1.0"}
  "cohttp-lwt-unix"
  "cohttp-async"
  "ssl"
  "lwt_ssl"
  "jose"
  "digestif" {>= "1.1.2"}
  "mirage-crypto-ec" {>= "1.2.0"}
  "mirage-crypto-rng" {>= "1.2.0"}
  "zarith"
  "zstandard" {>= "v0.16.0" & < "v0.18~"}
  "ppx_jane" {>= "v0.16.0" & < "v0.18~"}
  "ounit2" {with-test}
  "odoc" {with-doc}
]
build: [
  ["dune" "subst"] {dev}
  [
    "dune"
    "build"
    "-p"
    name
    "-j"
    jobs
    "@install"
    "@runtest" {with-test}
    "@doc" {with-doc}
  ]
]
